      "note": [
        "⛔ THE PARAGRAPH BELOW IS WRONG AND IS KEPT RATHER THAN DELETED, because what it got wrong is",
        "the most useful thing in this file. It read, in full:",
        "",
        "  '⭐ THE TWO PASSING CODES DIFFER (`hash_mismatch` vs `non_canonical_ecf`) AND BOTH ARE SCORED",
        "   PASS, WHICH IS CORRECT AND IS THE MOST INSTRUCTIVE ROW HERE. This requirement asserts the",
        "   FRAME and leaves the code unasserted, because no section of the specification assigns one for",
