  "not_in_this_file": [
    "THE OTHER 47 REQUIREMENTS. 25 more are implemented by suite 1 and were run against these same four",
    "peers, and their verdicts are NOT recorded here. That is deliberate: they are not in ADR-0003 shape,",
    "so no second suite can be built against them, so a control set for them would be data nobody can use.",
    "",
    "THE 36 DECLARED KEYSTONE PEERS. Unrun — their tree was held. Every row above is FOUR PEERS, three of",
    "which share ONE generation lineage. ⛔ That is cohort consistency, not independent convergence, and a",
    "control set of four is a starting point rather than a census.",
